{"id":"835b897a70b3fbc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition.md","title":"ZFC Measure2 Measurable Partition","display":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Partition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition","58-df-zfc-measure7-measurable-partition","58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-partition"],"display":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Partition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-measurable-partition</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-measurable-partition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition — ZFC Measure2 Measurable Partition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi,X,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Pi,X,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (partition, carrier, and sigma-algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\Pi,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\Pi\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\Pi\\land\n\\bigcup\\Pi=X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\Pi\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\emptyset)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\Pi,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\Pi\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\Pi\\land\n\\bigcup\\Pi=X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\Pi\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\emptyset)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The measure7 and measure11 measurable-partition variants are merged here. The finite measurable-partition variant is kept separate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi,X,\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}partition} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S(\\Pi,X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\Pi\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\Pi\\land\n\\bigcup\\Pi=X\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\Pi\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B=\\emptyset)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"8bad3810e4165411","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurablePartition}_S$ (measurable-partition predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition]])"},{"id":"03be65ef075305b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2574","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition.md|58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-partition]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6"]}